    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chingoba che Balawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babemeelesi be lisaaye lie Balawi bacha khu musaayi Eliesa ne Yoshua okhwa Nuni, ne khu bemeelesi be lisaaye liosi lie chikholo cha Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.35.1+NUM.35.2+NUM.35.3+NUM.35.4+NUM.35.5+NUM.35.6+NUM.35.7+NUM.35.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 35.1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baba e Shilo mu maloba ka Kanaani bababoolela bali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aalaka khubirira khu Musa ali khuebwe chingoba nicho khumenyamo, alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe ke chikhaafu chefwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono khuloondekhana ne lilaka lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi babaandu ba Isiraeli baelesia Balawi chingoba chichiindi ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe khukhwama khu ngoongo chabwe babeene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye lie kumuliango kwe Balawi kwa Kohati nilio lilianyoa khukabwa chingoba. Lisaaye lie Balawi liliama khu musaayi Aruni liaebwa chingoba likhumi ne chitaru khukhwama khu ngoongo cha Yuda, Simioni, ne Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumuliango kwa Kohati kukwarama kwakabwa chingoba likhumi khukhwama khu chingoongo cha Efuraimu, Dani, ne Manase eye mumbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be kumuliango kwa Kerishoni bakabwa chingoba likhumi na chitaru khukhwama khu maloba ka Isakari, Asheri, Nafutali, ne Manase eye bukwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye lie kumuliango kwa Merari liakabwa chingoba likhumi na chibili khukhwama khu maloba ka Rubeni, Kati, ne Sebuluni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwe khu khuupa chikura, babaandu ba Isiraeli bakaba chingoba ne kamaloba kabwe ke kamaayilwe khu Balawi, nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aalaka khubirira khu Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko kamasina ke chingoba khukhwama khu maloba ka Yuda ne Simioni ka kaakabwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khu lisaaye lia Aruni, be kumuliango kwa Kohati, enda eya Lawi. Kumukabo kwabwe nikwo kukwanyoa khukholekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaelesia lukoba lwa Kiriati-Ariba, (Ariba aaba raraawe owa Anaki). Olwo nilwo lukoba lwa Heburoni, mu sibala sie sikulu sia Yuda, alala ne kamaayilwe ka kalubotookhelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali, kimikuunda kie lukoba, alala ne birekere, biaba biamalwa khukabwa khu Kalebu okhwa Yefune nga kumukabo kwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutubakho Heburoni (lulala khu ngoba che omwiiri khumulilamo), chingoba chiloondakho chakabwa khu lisaaye lio omusaayi Aruni. Chingoba echo chaba Libuna ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatiri, Eshitemoa, shemeshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Holoni, Tebiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aini, Yuda, ne Beti-shemesi, alala ne kamaayilwe kabwe. Chingoba tisa chichakabwa khukhwama khu kholo cha Yuda ne Simioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu ekholo eya Benjamini babaandu ba Aruni lundi bakabwa chingoba chine: chingoba chino chaba, Kibeoni, Keba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatoti, ne Alumoni, alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono chingoba likhumi ne chitaru choosi alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe biakabwa khu basaayi, be lisaaye lia Aruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye liliindi lie kumuliango kwe Balawi be owa Kohati bakabwa chingoba chichiindi khukhwama khu kholo eya Efuraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabwa chingoba chine: Shekemu mu lukoongo lwe bikulu bia Efuraimu (lukoba olwo lwaba lwa omwiiri khumulilamo), Keseri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibisaimu, ne Beti-horoni, ne kamaloba kabwe ke kamaayilwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama khu kholo eya Dani bakabwa chingoba chine: Eliteke, Kibetioni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiyaloni, ne Kati-Rimoni, ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kaabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Manase eye mumbo, bakabwa chingoba chibili: Taanachi, ne Kati-Rimoni, alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye lino lie kumuliango kwa Kohati lia nyoola chingoba likhumi chong'ene, alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kaabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sipupu sisiindi sie Balawi kumuliango kwa Kerishoni, sianyoola khukhwama khu kholo eya Manase eye Bukwe chingoba chibili: Kolani mu Bashani (lulala khu ngoba che omwiiri khumulilamo) ne Beeshitera, alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Isakari banyoola chingoba chine: Kishioni, Taberati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yarimuti, ne Enganimu, alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Asheri banyoola chingoba chine: Mishali, Abitoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helikati, ne Rehobu, alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama khu kholo eya Nafutali banyoola chingoba chitaru: Kadeshi mu Kalilaya, (Kateshi luli lulala khu ngoba che omwiiri khumulilamo), Hamoti Tori, ne Karitani, alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kaabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye liliindi liliaukhaane lie kumuliango kwa Kerishoni lianyoola chingoba choosi likhumi ne chitaru alala ne kamaloba ke kamaayilwe kaabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
